<Base title="Skate with us" description="Membership, freestyle ice and US Figure Skating test sessions at Red Rose Figure Skating Club.">
  <h1>Skate with us</h1>
  <p class="lead">Everything for skaters who've moved past group classes.</p>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card"><h3>Membership</h3><p>Join the club for the July to June season. Includes US Figure Skating membership.</p><a href="/skate-with-us/membership">Membership</a></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Freestyle Ice</h3><p>Weekly practice ice times, rates and etiquette.</p><a href="/skate-with-us/freestyle-ice">Freestyle Ice</a></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Test Sessions</h3><p>US Figure Skating test dates, fees and how to register.</p><a href="/skate-with-us/test-sessions">Test Sessions</a></div>
  </div>
</Base>
